e is a natural and honest reflection of the player’s state. We are happy to partner with the <strong>VIWESA GAMES</strong> team, which has opened a new level of gaming interaction.”  — <strong>The Pulsoid Team</strong>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When the game feels your pulse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks to integration with Pulsoid, your real state directly affects the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline hunt:</strong> The darkness literally hears your heart. The higher your real pulse, the easier it is for monsters to track you, and from fear you will also drop items from your hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual tension:</strong> Your real emotions transform into visual and sound effects in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honesty with viewers:</strong> If you are a streamer, your audience will see your fear without embellishment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "PVE CO-OP horror survival game for 1-4 players in the cursed lands. Eternal night rules the world, demons rise from molten abysses, and darkness devours mankind. Only the Sun Cult guards the last light. You are the pilgrim-monk who must gather crystals and bring back the Sun.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/f8275bf0de47f6d90f1aa4e8c9d3eb1748e22a4b/header.jpg?t=1786967432", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/2394158220179c4eb2217da3c43df5e1d5176462/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786967432", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/2394158220179c4eb2217da3c43df5e1d51